---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Disclaimer - JKSPDC"
  description="Official Disclaimer for the JKSPDC website. Limitations of liability for information accuracy, external links, and technical issues."
>
  <div class="space-y-0 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <div class="page-header-band animate-fadeInUp">
      <nav class="breadcrumb-trail" aria-label="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span class="separator" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <span class="current">Disclaimer</span>
      </nav>
      <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">Jammu &amp; Kashmir State Power Development Corporation Limited (JKSPDCL)</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <article class="lg:col-span-2 prose-gov space-y-5">

        <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-lg p-4 text-xs text-amber-800 font-semibold flex items-start gap-2">
          <Icon name="alert-triangle" size={14} class="text-amber-800 shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
          <span><strong>DRAFT — FOR JKSPDC LEGAL REVIEW AND FORMAL APPROVAL BEFORE PUBLICATION.</strong></span>
        </div>

        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">1. General Disclaimer</h2>
          <p>The information on this website is published by Jammu &amp; Kashmir State Power Development Corporation Limited (JKSPDCL) for general informational and transparency purposes only. While every effort has been made to ensure the accuracy of information presented, JKSPDCL does not guarantee the completeness, accuracy, timeliness, or fitness for any particular purpose of the information contained herein.</p>
          <p class="mt-2">For legally binding and authoritative information, please refer to official Gazette notifications, Government orders, and other primary instruments.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">2. No Legal Advice</h2>
          <p>Nothing on this website constitutes legal, financial, engineering, or professional advice. Users should seek appropriate professional advice before relying on any information for regulatory, contractual, or legal purposes.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">3. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>JKSPDCL shall not be liable for any loss, damage, cost, or expense — whether direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential — arising from or in connection with:</p>
          <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm">
            <li>• Reliance on information on this website</li>
            <li>• Unavailability or interruption of the website or its services</li>
            <li>• Technical errors, omissions, or inaccuracies in content</li>
            <li>• Actions of third-party websites linked from this website</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">4. Tender &amp; Procurement Disclaimer</h2>
          <p>Tender notices, NIT documents, and related procurement information published on this website are for information purposes. Official tenders are issued through the <a href="https://jktenders.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#0B4F9C] hover:underline">J&amp;K Tenders Portal<span class="sr-only"> (opens in new tab)</span></a>. In case of any discrepancy between information on this website and the official NIT document, the official document shall prevail.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">5. External Links</h2>
          <p>This website may contain hyperlinks to external websites for convenience. JKSPDCL does not endorse, verify, or take responsibility for the content, privacy practices, or availability of external websites. Access to external websites is entirely at the user's own risk.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">6. Translation Disclaimer</h2>
          <p>Content translated into Hindi, Urdu, Kashmiri, and Dogri using the Bhashini translation service is provided as a convenience and may contain inaccuracies. The English version of any content is the authoritative and official version. In case of any conflict between translated and English content, the English version shall prevail.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">7. Updates &amp; Accuracy</h2>
          <p>JKSPDCL reserves the right to add, modify, or remove content from this website at any time without prior notice. Users should verify information with JKSPDCL directly for critical or time-sensitive matters.</p>
        </div>

        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-4">
          <strong>Effective Date:</strong> August 2026 | <strong>Last Reviewed:</strong> {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-IN', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long' })}
        </p>

      </article>

      <aside class="space-y-5">
        <div class="card-static">
          <h3 class="sidebar-card-title">Legal &amp; Policies</h3>
          <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2">
            <li><a href="/terms-conditions" class="sidebar-link">Terms &amp; Conditions</a></li>
            <li><a href="/privacy-policy" class="sidebar-link">Privacy Policy</a></li>
            <li><a href="/copyright" class="sidebar-link">Copyright Policy</a></li>
            <li><a href="/hyperlinking-policy" class="sidebar-link">Hyperlinking Policy</a></li>
            <li><a href="/accessibility-statement" class="sidebar-link">Accessibility Statement</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
